# Miana project rules

## Stack

- Frontend: Astro 4 + Tailwind → static `dist/` served by Worker `ASSETS`
- Backend: Cloudflare Worker (`worker/`), D1 via Drizzle, R2 for diagnostic photos
- Email: Resend in prod, Mailpit locally (`just dev`)
- No KV for app data - rate limits and sessions live in D1

## Conventions

- Timestamps in D1 are **milliseconds** (`Date.now()`)
- Lead types: `skin-call` | `bridal` | `beauty` | `education`
- Lead statuses: `novo` | `pendente` | `aceite` | `eliminado`
- Pricing/timing/contacts: read from `settings` via `pricing.ts` / scheduling helpers - do not hardcode new prices in templates
- Quote templates in `worker/templates/*` already call `wrapEmail` - `sendQuoteEmail` must not wrap again with the same footer
- Prefer editing existing Worker modules over inventing new frameworks
- Client escalation items → `docs/CLIENT-TODO.md` (PT) + Notion; engineering → `TODO.md`

## Dev

- Full stack: `just dev` (:8787). UI-only: `just dev-astro` (:4321)
- Never commit passwords or `.dev.vars` / `.env`
- After Worker changes: `npm run worker:check` and `./tests/run.sh` when the API is up

## Docs

- Architecture: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Dev/ECC/CI: `docs/DEV.md`
